{"id":"dog-breeds","title":"Most popular dog breeds in the US (AKC registrations, 2025)","prompt":"Name the 10 most popular dog breeds in the US by American Kennel Club registrations in 2025","noun":"dog breeds","category":"Oddball","metric":"AKC rank (registrations, 2025)","lowerIsBetter":true,"source":{"name":"Wikipedia: List of most popular dog breeds","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_most_popular_dog_breeds","asOf":"2026-11-08","dataAsOf":"2025"},"answers":[{"rank":1,"name":"French Bulldog","aliases":["French Bulldogs","Frenchie","Frenchies","Frenchy"],"value":"#1","n":1,"article":"French Bulldogs","fact":{"text":"In 2003 it was only the AKC's 54th most popular breed. Ten years later it was 10th.","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/French_Bulldog"}},{"rank":2,"name":"Labrador Retriever","aliases":["Labrador dog","Labrador Retrievers","Yellow Labrador","Yellow lab","Lab retriever","Brown lab","Chocolate lab","Yellow labrador retriever","Golden lab","Black labrador","Labradors","Labrador","Labordor retreiver","Chocolate Labrador","Labrador retreiver","Golden Labrador Retriever","Yellow labs","Lab dog","Chocolate Labrador Retriever","Black labrador retriever","Gold Labrador","Lab","Labs","Black Lab"],"value":"#2","n":2,"article":"Labrador Retriever","fact":{"text":"Bred in Britain from Newfoundland's St. John's water dogs, and named after Labrador, a region of that colony.","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Labrador_Retriever"}},{"rank":3,"name":"Golden Retriever","aliases":["Golden retrievers","Golden retreiver","Golden retrivers","Golden retriver","English cream retriever","GoldenRetriever","Golden Retriever dog","Golden","Goldens","Goldie"],"value":"#3","n":3,"article":"Golden Retriever","fact":{"text":"Bred on a Scottish estate from Nous, the only yellow pup in a litter of black Flat-coated Retrievers.","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Golden_Retriever"}},{"rank":4,"name":"German Shepherd","aliases":["Alsatian dog","Alsatian","Schä